      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The key to distinguishing a \"rhetorical tactic\" from a \"legitimate technical warning\" in this context is to look beyond the political claims to the *specific, quantifiable technical and regulatory requirements for the change to happen successfully in the first place, and how the bill addresses those needs in real terms for the next 5-10 years of aggressive build-",
      "source": "target",
